  "body": "Display: contents elements have no box, so it's weird that they can be editing roots, given their children are parented outside of it.\r\n\r\nThis is just one example, but there should probably be detailed explanations of how it interacts with all this, also with selection.\r\n\r\nRight now what Gecko happens to do with contenteditable / designMode + display: contents makes no sense :)",
